msgid "64-bit interface token appended to the dynamic /64 prefix, for example ::8888 or ::be24:11ff:fe12:3456."
msgstr "拼接到运营商动态 /64 前缀后的固定主机后缀，例如 ::8888 或 ::be24:11ff:fe12:3456。"

